  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the pot and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pot and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the fish sauce, soy sauce, and brown sugar to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir in the dark chocolate chips until melted and smooth.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles."
